{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15051","headline":"元日朝回中夜书情寄南宫二故人 · 卢纶","name":"元日朝回中夜书情寄南宫二故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸣佩随鵷鹭，登堦见冕旒。\n无能裨圣代，何事别沧洲。\n闲夜贫还醉，浮名老渐羞。\n凤城春欲晚，郎吏忆同游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}